---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Pakistan Finance Calculators"
  description="Privacy policy for Pakistan Finance Calculators: no accounts, no stored inputs, calculations run in your browser."
  slug="/privacy/"
>
  <div class="container prose-narrow" style="padding-top:40px;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 28 October 2026.</p>
    <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No accounts and no sign-up.</li>
      <li>Nothing you type into a calculator is stored, logged, or sent to a server for calculation. Calculations run in your browser.</li>
      <li>No calculator input is put in a URL, an analytics event, or an error report.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Rates</h2>
    <p>
      Currency and gold rates are public figures fetched once a day by a
      same-origin service so API keys stay secret. That service receives
      no user input. Cached rate snapshots contain only public rates and
      timestamps.
    </p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      No analytics is added at launch. If privacy-friendly analytics is
      added later, it will not record calculator inputs or amounts, and
      this page will be updated first.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent through the
      <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
